# Identifies this app to api.weather.gov. NWS asks for an app name plus a contact
# (website or email) so they can reach you if your traffic causes problems.
# Copy to .env.local and fill in a real contact before deploying.
VITE_NWS_USER_AGENT="WeatherMap/1.0 (you@example.com)"

# Optional: live traffic on the map (Layers → Traffic). A free key from developer.tomtom.com
# (Traffic API; the free tier includes a daily allowance of map tiles). Restrict it to your site's domain.
VITE_TOMTOM_KEY=""
